{"id":"03_machine_learning_03_practicas_midterm_capstone_peliculas_practica_peliculas_ok_docs_02_p2_modelado_pycaret_peliculas_ud3_pycaret_env","label":"Entorno pixi ud3-pycaret","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/datos/RafaelAlberti/RafaelAlberti26_27/Modulos/PIA/03-machine-learning/03-practicas/midterm-capstone/Peliculas/Practica_Peliculas_OK/docs/02-P2_Modelado_PyCaret_Peliculas.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Entorno autónomo pixi con Python 3.11 y NumPy 1.26 porque PyCaret 3.3 declara compatibilidad numpy >=1.21,<1.27; el pin >=1.26,<1.27 evita mezclarlo con NumPy 2 de la base común. No compone las dependencias generales de UD3 ni GPU: P2 se ejecuta solo en CPU."},
{"id":"03_machine_learning_03_practicas_midterm_capstone_peliculas_practica_peliculas_ok_docs_02_p2_modelado_pycaret_peliculas_flow","label":"Flujo setup/compare_models/tune_model/predict_model","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/datos/RafaelAlberti/RafaelAlberti26_27/Modulos/PIA/03-machine-learning/03-practicas/midterm-capstone/Peliculas/Practica_Peliculas_OK/docs/02-P2_Modelado_PyCaret_Peliculas.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Flujo obligatorio: setup con train_size=0.8, session_id=42 y fold=5 reserva un holdout del 20%; compare_models y tune_model usan CV de cinco folds solo sobre entrenamiento; predict_model sin data= evalúa el holdout una única vez. PyCaret aprende las transformaciones en su pipeline; el holdout no se usa para volver a comparar o ajustar."},
{"id":"03_machine_learning_03_practicas_midterm_capstone_peliculas_practica_peliculas_ok_docs_02_p2_modelado_pycaret_peliculas_lazypredict","label":"LazyPredict vs PyCaret","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/datos/RafaelAlberti/RafaelAlberti26_27/Modulos/PIA/03-machine-learning/03-practicas/midterm-capstone/Peliculas/Practica_Peliculas_OK/docs/02-P2_Modelado_PyCaret_Peliculas.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},
